  "mode": "both",
  "scriptText": "1.  다음을 듣고,  남자가 하는 말의 목적으로 가장 적절한 것을 고르시오.\n\nM:  Hello, visitors to Cryston Beach. This is an announcement from the management office.  As  you  know,  this  beach  is  famous  for  its  beautiful  black  stones.  Unfortunately, there were some cases where visitors damaged the beach by taking stones. To protect the beach, you must not take any stones from the beach. This is actually the law, so if you take any stones, you may have to pay a penalty of 1,000 dollars. Once again, do not take the stones from the beach. This will help protect its natural beauty and ecosystem. Please enjoy your time at Cryston Beach. Thank you.",
